### Get all books
GET http://localhost:9080/library-app/api/books

### Get not/existing book
GET http://localhost:9080/library-app/api/books/9e36227a-421a-4889-9597-585087753111

### Put new book
PUT http://localhost:9080/library-app/api/authors/a2b8423d-6073-4e57-acbc-f195e6263bb3/books/a2b8423d-6073-4e57-acbc-f195e6263bb0
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "A book",
  "releaseDate": "2020-10-11",
  "genre": "FANTASY",
  "user": "3933ea4a-76ae-4112-bf74-4f3634e1a47c"
}

### Get new book
GET http://localhost:9080/library-app/api/books/a2b8423d-6073-4e57-acbc-f195e6263bb0

### Patch new book
PATCH http://localhost:9080/library-app/api/books/a2b8423d-6073-4e57-acbc-f195e6263bb0
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "A nice book",
  "releaseDate": "2020-10-11",
  "genre": "FANTASY"
}

### Delete book
DELETE http://localhost:9080/library-app/api/books/a2b8423d-6073-4e57-acbc-f195e6263bb0



### Get Books by Author
GET http://localhost:9080/library-app/api/authors/a2b8423d-6073-4e57-acbc-f195e6263bb3/books

### Patch atomic habits
PATCH http://localhost:9080/library-app/api/books/9e36227a-421a-4889-9597-585087753111
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Atomic habits updated",
  "releaseDate": "2020-10-11",
  "genre": "TUTORIAL"
}

### Get Books by User
GET http://localhost:9080/library-app/api/users/e6b416b3-5b6e-4303-b423-16ab1de3afc1/books

